H
"SentenceLength"/en"句子长度"/zh-CN"句子長度"/zh-TW
===
¶Type in the chat bar and it counts your sentence's characters.¶
sentence: Chat()
length: Chat().length()

Group(
	Stack() 
	[
		Phrase(`*Hello! Welcome to the sentence length calculator.*` place: Place(0m 1m ))
		Phrase("Type something in the message bar!" place: Place(0m -1m))
		Phrase("Your sentence is " + (length → '') + " characters long!" resting: Sequence.sway(duration: 3s) place: Place(0m -3m))
		Phrase(sentence place: Place(0m -5m) wrap: 25m)
	])